      "key": "zander-benchmark",
      "path": "figure_segment_insight.dark.png",
      "title": {
        "en": "Benchmark Evidence",
        "de": "Benchmark-Evidenz"
      },
      "caption": {
        "en": "*The station-balanced median is −5.0 dB; the Joint-Spot median is −7.0 dB. Both favor the larger vertical.*",
        "de": "*Der stationsgleichgewichtete Median beträgt −5,0 dB, der Median der Joint Spots −7,0 dB. Beide sprechen für die größere Vertikalantenne.*"
      },
      "alt": {
        "en": "Decode Outcomes, Station Medians and Joint-Spot Delta SNR: 37 of 85 receiver entries contribute 166 Joint Spots; station-balanced median −5 dB and pooled median −7 dB.",
